# Neutral alias for netlify/functions/brevo-proxy (staff email sends + open tracking).
# Ad blockers and network filters match the vendor name "brevo" anywhere in a URL and
# kill the request in the browser, which surfaces as "Email send failed: Failed to
# fetch". Must stay ABOVE the /* SPA catch-all or it would resolve to index.html.
/api/mail-send  /.netlify/functions/brevo-proxy  200
/roster.html  /roster.html  200
/review       /review.html  200
/*    /index.html   200
